// LOCALHOST
### Get all contacts
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts

### Get Contact by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts/6a9edb74f116474145d4ba1d

### Create contact
POST http://localhost:3000/contacts/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Lina",
    "lastName": "Lulu",
    "email": "linalulu@example.com",
    "favoriteColor": "blue",
    "birthday": "1961-01-01"
}

